<newsitem itemid="245834" id="root" date="1996-12-10" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mathomo raises maiden yr shr, no dividend.</title>
<headline>Mathomo raises maiden yr shr, no dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  30.09	  vs	24.86</p>
<p>    - diluted		 26.12	  vs	21.76</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   10.71	  vs	6.76</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   14.23	  vs	10.38</p>
<p>    Tax			  3.52	  vs	3.62</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    1.61	  vs	1.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		 130.32	  vs	120.63</p>
<p>Full name: Mathomo Group Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said capitalisation shares equivalent to five cents a share would be issued in lieu of a final dividend in order to conserve cash for growth.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
